<figure class="mechanic-figure autofix-figure" aria-labelledby="autofix-title">
  <div class="figure-heading"><div><h3 id="autofix-title">Try a change, keep it only if it helps</h3></div></div>
  <ol class="decision-flow"><li><span>01</span><strong>Compile</strong><small>Blocked if source is invalid</small></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Check the drawing</strong><small>Return unchanged when clean</small></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Try view changes</strong><small>Routes, placements, or full view</small></li><li><span>04</span><strong>Reject new hard findings</strong><small>Check the affected elements too</small></li><li><span>05</span><strong>Compare results</strong><small>Require a clear improvement</small></li><li><span>06</span><strong>Keep the smallest change</strong><small>Used when quality ties</small></li></ol>
  <div class="strategy-rail" aria-label="Alternative candidate strategies"><b>Try separately</b><span>targeted routes</span><span>all routes</span><span>targeted placements</span><span>full view</span></div>
  <div class="outcome-strip"><span class="outcome-good">repaired</span><span>unchanged</span><span>unresolved</span><span class="outcome-stop">blocked</span></div>
  <figcaption>Each strategy is tested separately.</figcaption>
</figure>
